      "assessment": "Source targets XeLaTeX/LuaLaTeX/pdfLaTeX with latexmk and BibTeX/Biber as applicable; existing project discovers Pandoc/Tectonic with approved numbered Markdown references. Do not silently replace the working toolchain or require all alternative engines. Backend orchestration remains Python; TeX and rendering binaries are external tools, not a second business backend language."
